  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 11th level, whenever the conduit produces an esoterica, they can exhaust the magical item to apply one of the following metamagic feats to the produced effect: Elemental Spell, Empower Spell, Enlarge Spell, Extend Spell, or Widen Spell. A metamagic feat applied to an esoterica does not require spell points to be spent, nor does it increase the casting time of the esoterica.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/conduit#toc18\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
